Description: 'SAS' and 'R' are different in many ways. To ease the
    transition to 'R' from 'SAS', 'segue' has convenience functions aimed
    at replicating 'SAS' analyses with an idiomatic 'R' syntax. The choice
    of functions is biased towards clinical statistics, with an emphasis
    on ease of use, compatibility, and discoverability.
